<title>FRANCE: France sets 4.5 pct coupon on new 2002 BTAN lines.</title>
<headline>France sets 4.5 pct coupon on new 2002 BTAN lines.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The coupon on a new 2002 BTAN to be issued for the first time on July 17 in both French francs and ecus will be 4.50 percent, the Treasury said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The payment date will be July 24.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
